### Registrar un nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "Rodrygo Goeeeeees",
	"email": "abcd@gmail.com",
	"password": "Abcd",
	"description": "Hola soy Rodrigo",
	"rol": "USER"
}

### Logearse
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "Paco",
	"password": "Abcd1234"
}

### Get me
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImVvcmR1bmFwQGhvdG1haWwuY29tIiwic3ViIjoiUGFjbyIsImlhdCI6MTc2MjcxNTYzMywiZXhwIjoxNzYyNzE1OTMzfQ.cJw7GEoOp7doPRyYu8rAGQFfosSoSS8OFBzzg9n25Zo

